data: {"type":"TOOL_CALL_RESULT","toolCallId":"setup-plan","messageId":"dc45e3cb-4d40-4ca9-9fa1-1fc308fbd5d2","content":"{\"ok\":true,\"result\":{\"status\":\"authorized\",\"scopeHash\":\"338d0e4fcfa65b6cf1fcaf8fdbc7e8b35fd61fdf27af5c0427141db718cd5383\",\"planHash\":\"338d0e4fcfa65b6cf1fcaf8fdbc7e8b35fd61fdf27af5c0427141db718cd5383\",\"targetPluginId\":\"quick-help-dismiss\",\"deliveryContract\":{\"capability\":\"帮助卡片 headerActions 中的「知道了」按钮收起卡片正文，点击标题可重新展开，主题切换后行为保持\",\"dependencies\":[\"@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins 的 UIPluginComponentProps、usePluginInstance、useAgentUILocaleCode\",\"项目内共享模块提供卡片展开/收起控制器 Context\",\"quick-help-card 渲染 headerActions 时用该 Context Provider 包裹子插件\"],\"interactions\":[\"点击「知道了」后帮助正文不可见\",\"点击卡片标题后帮助正文重新出现\",\"连续多轮收起/展开保持正确\",\"切换主题后点击「知道了」仍能收起，点击标题仍能展开\",\"键盘 Enter/Space 可激活按钮，focus-visible 可见焦点环\",\"zh-CN 显示「知道了」，en-US 显示对应英文标签\"],\"lifecycle\":\"随卡片挂载/卸载；点击「知道了」把卡片置为收起（正文隐藏），点击标题置为展开；状态保存在卡片本地 React 状态，不随主题切换重建\",\"placement\":\"quick-help-card 实例 p24 的 headerActions Slot（布局 slot l10 内卡片头部右侧）\",\"renderingCategory\":\"semantic-slot\",\"reusedComponents\":[\"quick-help-card 现有 header 幽灵按钮样式约定\",\"现有 locale 文案机制\"],\"verificationMethod\":\"runtime\"},\"services\":[]}}","role":"tool"}

