册与 Custom Event 边界。\",\"sha256\":\"b2b0b4d9fc70734ea3ee03799137bfd83827b8a827c8b032008991dab1337b48\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"internal:architecture/p3r-0-assistant-ui-conversation-domain-rebaseline\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s19\",\"title\":\"渲染与语义组合\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"internal:architecture/p3r-0-assistant-ui-conversation-domain-rebaseline\",\"sectionId\":\"s19\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"Conversation Domain 架构\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"internal:architecture/p3r-0-assistant-ui-conversation-domain-rebaseline\",\"sectionId\":\"s1\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s27\",\"title\":\"应用层与 upstream\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"internal:architecture/p3r-0-assistant-ui-conversation-domain-rebaseline\",\"sectionId\":\"s27\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:development/component-customization\",\"title\":\"组件属性与组合定制\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/component-customization.md\",\"summary\":\"修改已有插件时，先打开项目中的 plugins/<插件名>/index.tsx。它是项目自己的定制入口，可以给公开组件传属性、替换子组件或自定义渲染函数。完成这些修改不需要接管官方源码。 各插件页面的“手动开发 → 属性”列出完整属性、类型、默认行为与嵌套配置。页面会分别说明可修改的展示属性，以及会话自动传入的数据和方法。调整外观时，保留原有传参和函数调用。\",\"sha256\":\"e8f9ff31359c913cec4518990775e1e1bc05bd1b71a2f98bf7a69076668f8129\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/component-customization\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s49\",\"title\":\"选择合适的定制方式\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/component-customization\",\"sectionId\":\"s49\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"组件属性与组合定制\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/component-customization\",\"sectionId\":\"s1\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s7\",\"title\":\"示例：调整输入框\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/component-customization\",\"sectionId\":\"s7\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"title\":\"插件开发接口\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/plugin-api.md\",\"summary\":\"项目插件由能力声明、组件和可选的服务生命周期组成。创建文件与注册步骤见创建自定义插件。修改已有官方插件外观时，先使用组件公开属性。\",\"sha256\":\"cd30e68bc788dd22fdccc937313217ed5e3c3816b86e84f9138f758709423720\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s72\",\"title\":\"组件与子插槽\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s72\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s5\",\"title\":\"公共能力速查\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s5\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"插件开发接口\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s1\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:plugins/conversation-surface\",\"title\":\"会话界面（conversation-surface）\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"插件\",\"path\":\"plugins/conversation-surface.md\",\"summary\":\"用户可以在同一区域阅读已有对话、查看新回复并继续提问；工具结果、计划等内容会显示在对应的消息中。 日常调整可以交给 Creator；需要自己写代码时，直接查看手动开发。\",\"sha256\":\"cb9a7212f21a1f1e94e3f22365bd88ac21a7638cc4d0b6b9c50c48c97925fc4c\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:plugins/conversation-surface\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s35\",\"title\":\"属性\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:plugins/conversation-surface\",\"sectionId\":\"s35\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s31\",\"title\":\"手动开发\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:plugins/conversation-surface\",\"sectionId\":\"s31\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"会话界面（conversation-surface）\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:plugins/conversation-surface\",\"sectionId\":\"s1\"}}}]}],\"nextOffset\":8}}","role":"tool"}

