创建自定义插件。修改已有官方插件外观时，先使用组件公开属性。\",\"sha256\":\"cd30e68bc788dd22fdccc937313217ed5e3c3816b86e84f9138f758709423720\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s72\",\"title\":\"组件与子插槽\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s72\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"插件开发接口\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s1\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s5\",\"title\":\"公共能力速查\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s5\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:plugins/conversation-surface\",\"title\":\"会话界面（conversation-surface）\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"插件\",\"path\":\"plugins/conversation-surface.md\",\"summary\":\"用户可以在同一区域阅读已有对话、查看新回复并继续提问；工具结果、计划等内容会显示在对应的消息中。 日常调整可以交给 Creator；需要自己写代码时，直接查看手动开发。\",\"sha256\":\"cb9a7212f21a1f1e94e3f22365bd88ac21a7638cc4d0b6b9c50c48c97925fc4c\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:plugins/conversation-surface\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s35\",\"title\":\"属性\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:plugins/conversation-surface\",\"sectionId\":\"s35\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s31\",\"title\":\"手动开发\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:plugins/conversation-surface\",\"sectionId\":\"s31\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"会话界面（conversation-surface）\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:plugins/conv